---
// MDX's `table`: a table in a page's own words, in a box that scrolls sideways when the table is
// wider than the column (the page never does), and takes keyboard focus so it can be scrolled.
// Looks: site/system/styles/prose.css (.site-table-scroll).
---

<div class="site-table-scroll" tabindex="0"><table><slot /></table></div>
